# TTT Backend — project context

Pet project in active development: a knowledge base of theoretical technical interview questions with detailed answers.

## Stack

- Laravel 12, PHP 8.4
- Filament 3 (admin panel)
- Sanctum (API auth), Spatie Permission (roles/permissions)
- API versioned under `routes/api.php` → prefix `v1`, route names `api.v1.*`

## Domain (main entities)

- **Question** — title, answer, status workflow (pending/approved/rejected), tags, grades, companies, positions
- **Comment** — threaded comments on questions
- **Company / Position / Tag / Grade** — taxonomy and filtering
- **Suggestion** — user proposals for companies/positions linked to questions
- **Statistic** — user-reported interview encounter data
- **Notification** — in-app notifications with categories/types

## Layer map

| Layer | Location |
|-------|----------|
| API controllers | `app/Http/Controllers/v1/` |
| Form requests + DTO | `app/Http/Requests/v1/`, `app/DTOs/v1/` |
| Shared traits | `app/Traits/` — see [traits.mdc](traits.mdc) |
| Services | `app/Services/api/v1/` |
| Repositories | `app/Repositories/v1/` |
| List/query filters | `app/Http/Filters/v1/` |
| Policies | `app/Policies/` (API: `app/Policies/v1/`) |
| Filament admin | `app/Filament/` |
| Feature tests | `tests/Feature/v1/` |
| Service providers | `app/Providers/` — see [providers.mdc](providers.mdc) |
| App settings | `config/settings.php`, `App\Enums\Settings\Section` — see [settings.mdc](settings.mdc) |

Follow the scoped rules in `.cursor/rules/` when editing matching files.
